oindent{Verifying condition ef{Cond 1}:} The condition ef{Cond 1} with $\lambda_d=1$ follows from the Prime Number Theorem \cite[Chapter 18]{dav} together with the fact that for any $y\geq 2$,  egin{align} \sum_{\substack{n\leq y\ (n, bd)>1}}\Lambda(n) \ll (\log bd)(\log y). \end{align} 
